  "notes": "### Added\n- Paste, drop or choose files in notes and task descriptions. Images appear inline; other files appear as cards with an Open action. Files are saved under `attachments/` with a 25 MB per-file limit; referenced files use encrypted Sync.\n- Reorder tasks and subtasks by dragging, task actions, Alt+Up/Down, CLI or MCP. Children move with their parent; the order is saved in Tasks.md.\n- New workspaces get a dismissible Get started checklist at the top of Today, with quick actions for the first task, first note, calendar, AI agents and Sync.\n\n### Changed\n- On phones, Money shows Budgets before transactions.\n- Notes hide internal frontmatter and task markers in the editor, preview, snippets and search while preserving metadata on save.\n\n### Fixed\n- The Add event reminder menu works again. All-day local reminders fire at 09:00 local time or earlier; Google event forms explain why Pyxida reminders are unavailable.",
